;; ShiftLefter config for the 2FA password-reset demo.
;;
;; Two interfaces: a real browser (Etaoin/Chrome) and a mock SMS line.
;; The actual MockSMS *instance* used at runtime is supplied by setup.clj —
;; it shares the same in-memory log with the fixture HTTP server stood up
;; alongside, so the code the server sends is the code the framework's
;; SMS receive step polls for.
;;
;; Subjects glossary declares :user/alice; the Login intent supplies the
;; form's locators. Both are discovered at the conventional paths next to
;; this config (glossary/subjects.edn, glossary/intents/) — no :glossaries
;; key needed. Verb glossaries for :web and :sms are auto-loaded from
;; framework defaults. No custom steps — the SMS code crosses to the
;; browser via the scenario data plane ((?<code>...) -> {code}, sl-yh7),
;; so there is no steps/ directory anymore.

{:interfaces {:web {:type :web :adapter :etaoin :config {}}
              :sms {:type :sms :adapter :sms-mock}}
 :enforcement        {:unknown-subject :error
              :unknown-verb    :warn
              :unknown-interface :error}}
